[node name="EmptyHook" type="Area2D" parent="Interactables"]
z_index = 31
position = Vector2(130, -196)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("5_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the Herbs"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]The drying cord[/b]

Yarrow, feverfew, comfrey, willow bark, each bundle tagged with a scrap of bark and a word in Maud's spiky letters.

At the end of the cord one hook hangs empty. Its tag reads: 'fever-root. None since the Hollow took the forest road. Grows wet, under ash.'"
reexamine_text = "Every hook full but one: fever-root, none since the Hollow took the road."

