[node name="CaseBook" type="Area2D" parent="Interactables"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(60, -110)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("5_story_item")
interaction_name = "Read the Case Book"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]Maud's case book[/b]

Years of patients in a cramped hand. One entry, five winters old: 'Merchant's wife. Grey fever. Came to me too late, and with too little coin. Fever-root eased her. Did not save her. The old physicians in the Capitol steeped the root with a white salt from the deep vein in the east. I have never had the salt.'

A newer line, the ink still dark: 'The merchant's girl. Cough at the turn of the season. Same as the mother. And yet she does not worsen. Someone is giving her what I cannot.'

The last entry has no name: 'A boy, sixteen or so, in off the ridge at midsummer, half dead. Two fingers gone from the left hand. White dust in every cut on him, fine as flour, and it bites the tongue like salt. He will say nothing but: we dig the white stone. If the Hollow learns he is here, the village pays. Not a word.'"
reexamine_text = "'Same as the mother, and yet she does not worsen.' And a nameless boy with two fingers gone: 'we dig the white stone.'"

