[node name="BloodiedRag" type="Area2D" parent="Interactables"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(200, 150)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("5_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the Rag"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]A bloodied rag[/b]

Stuffed under the cot: linen stiff with old blood, and wrapped inside it, a silver coin with a notch cut in the edge.

Pinned to it, in Maud's hand: 'Knife cut, left forearm. Would not give his name. Smelled of woodsmoke and horse. Paid well.' A healer on the forest road does not ask whose side her patients are on."
reexamine_text = "A notched silver coin, paid for a knife wound by a man who would not give his name."

