[node name="HerbCurtain" type="Area2D" parent="Interactables"]
z_index = 31
position = Vector2(205, -40)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("5_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look behind the Herbs"
flag_to_set = "davin_found"
discovery_text = "[b]Behind the herb curtain[/b]

In the corner past the worktable, a curtain of drying herbs hangs floor to rafter, too thick to be only for drying. Behind it is a nook with a straw pallet, a water jug and a bucket of grey wash-water.

A boy is curled on the straw, fevered, watching you over a blanket. Sixteen or so, with a smith's shoulders gone thin. His left hand is bound, and the binding is the wrong shape: two fingers are gone. There is white dust worked into the cuts on his arms.

He knows your face is a stranger's. 'Don't,' he says. 'If they know I'm out, they take two.' Then, as if it were all he has left: 'We dig the white stone.'

Davin. The smith's boy, taken in the second Tithe. Alive."
reexamine_text = "Davin, Bjorn's apprentice, hiding fevered behind Maud's herbs. Alive."

